title: "TalkBack Triage Pilot: do TalkBack reproduction steps and the app version change how an AI triages Android accessibility bug reports?"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Boosa
    given-names: Anirudh Yadav
    affiliation: University of North Texas
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/anirudh763/talkback-triage-pilot"
